  (text "Signals are connected by net labels of the same name. Power symbols: +3V3, +5V, GND, VMOT_SW (motor supply after the E-stop)." (at 12.70 24.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b580a4e6-8574-5d94-bcd8-15aae782fc13"))
  (text "Confirmed by the documents: STM32 pins (ARM_SENSOR_HUB.md), mux address 0x70 and axis N on channel N+2, encoder fitted per axis," (at 12.70 27.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a2c975c8-ae79-584d-bec6-39976d1a52e9"))
  (text "drive models and CAN IDs 0x001 to 0x006 (SYSTEM_CONFIGURATION.md 2.1, 2.2), Pi header pins 19/21/23/24/22 (Pi README), 12 to 24 V drive supply (MKS manual)." (at 12.70 31.20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b5cbad85-387b-5ec9-9518-0aebb256fa81"))
  (text "Provisional (not stated in any document): STM32 board type and its 5 V input; TJA1050 S pin tie; I2C pull-up values, location and rails" (at 12.70 34.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c4f546fc-bfe2-5cda-989d-d5f46048d5f4"))
  (text "(main bus drawn to +3V3; channel SCx/SDx pull-ups expected on the breakouts, rail not recorded); mux supply (drawn +3V3);" (at 12.70 38.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "10410791-ccd9-5f6d-b930-213dfd185c60"))
  (text "mux RESET pull-up (no MCU line, FW-12); AS5600 DIR tied low; termination placement;" (at 12.70 41.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "845ce433-c1e8-5f6e-9513-d92be1862384"))
  (text "motor supply voltage; the E-stop itself (SAFE-01, ruling R25b: to be fitted); drive switch and motor phase wiring (Arctos drawing, bench check)." (at 12.70 44.80 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "276f8724-f5b9-56b6-b58a-ecbd87aa4370"))
  (text "Decoupling on breakout boards is not drawn. Gripper parts (Nano, MCP2515, servo) are out of scope and not drawn (charter)." (at 12.70 48.20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7c28b902-6979-5b58-b535-66d4de3469f2"))
  (text "Generated by Hardware/bench-wiring/generate_schematic.py; edit the script, not this file, then regenerate. Run ERC in KiCad after any change." (at 12.70 51.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bcfbacb2-0fbc-58d6-9105-0ee55223f0c2"))
